    """
    Accepts a list of alternatives, and enumerates all their possible concatenations.

    Examples:
        >>> combine_alternatives([range(2), [4,5]])
        [[0, 4], [0, 5], [1, 4], [1, 5]]

        >>> combine_alternatives(["abc", "xy", '$'])
